105459	105539	105542	105542	she	3864	" Oh ! I was mad with grief , and pain in my eyes , and wanted to kill myself , when I lost my dear little Jeannot , at Vibraye . I fancied I had n't been careful enough with him . I was crazed ! Do n't you remember writing to me there , Taffy -- through Angèle Boisse ? Such a sweet letter you wrote ! I know it by heart ! And you too , Sandy "
