113824	113831	113840	113840	Trilby	388	" Ah ! my dear child ... "
113851	113874	113897	113898	Mrs. Bagot	588	" I 'm going to die , I suppose . Oh yes ! oh yes ! There 's no mistake about that ! "
113875	113891	113928	113928	she	388	" Dear Trilby , we are all in the hands of an Almighty Merciful God ! "
