124370	124554	124235	124235	he	359	" _ There were two Trilbys . _ There was the Trilby you knew , who could not sing one single note in tune . She was an angel of paradise . She is now ! But she had no more idea of singing than I have of winning a steeple - chase at the croix de Berny . She could no more sing than a fiddle can play itself ! She could never tell one tune from another -- one note from the next . Do you remember how she tried to sing ' Ben Bolt ' that day when she first came to the studio in the Place St. Anatole des Arts ? It was droll , _ hein ? à se boucher les oreilles _ ! Well , that was Trilby , your Trilby ! that was my Trilby too -- and I loved her as one loves an only love , an only sister , an only child -- a gentle martyr on earth , a blessed saint in heaven ! And that Trilby was enough for _ me _ !
124555	124628	124235	124235	he	359	" And that was the Trilby that loved your brother , madame -- oh ! but with all the love that was in her ! He did not know what he had lost , your brother ! Her love , it was immense , like her voice , and just as full of celestial sweetness and sympathy ! She told me everything ! _ ce pauvre Litrebili , ce qu'il a perdu _ !
